[518.717454, "o", "open(\"answer.md\",\"w\").write(f\"Letter lines at odds with the record: {at}\\n\\nI reviewed every numbered line in the draft letter against the client's two messages and the review protocol. Where the clarification speaks to a subject, it governs; where it is silent, the original instruction governs; where neither record speaks, the line is not in the record at all. The result is that {at} lines are at odds with the record, {cnt['VERIFIED']} lines are verified, and {cnt['NOT_IN_RECORD']} lines are not in the record. I am not sending the letter until each line is corrected to match the governing entry.\\n\")\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
